  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "# Changelog\n## 10.0.0.12 - 2026-11-06\n- missed changes added for error version 10.0.0.11 \n\n## 10.0.0.11 - 2026-11-06\n- Fix single level error of validationException(message) so all 400 errors comes inside details\n- Nest validation error JSON as error.code, error.message, and error.details\n\n## 10.0.0.10 - 2026-11-05 \n- Added Support for Capture Failed Transaction Status\n\n## 10.0.0.9 - 2026-11-05\n- Removed IsdCode from Contact model\n\n## 10.0.0.8 - 2026-11-03\n- Added Sonar Issue fix\n\n## 10.0.0.7 - 2026-11-03\n- renamed AMS360 to AMS\n\n## 10.0.0.6 - 2026-11-02 \n- Added invariant-culture legacy API DateTime formatting support\n\n## 10.0.0.5 - 2026-10-16 \n- AMS feature renamed back to AMS360\n\n## 10.0.0.4 - 2026-10-15 \n- Modify error message \"Invalid routing number.\"\n\n## 10.0.0.3 - 2026-10-08 \n- renamed AMS360 to AMS\n\n## 10.0.0.2 - 2026-08-24\n- .net10 migration including github actions\n\n## 8.0.0.25 - 2026-08-20\n- Added shared cache serialization, validation, expiration handling, and structured operation logging.",
